        "summary": "Gravity Index tool calls now render as verb-first labels like 'Search services' instead of 'Services 烷 Search' in gravity-index.tsx, and the `gravity_index` renderer drops the BRAND/withSubcommand pattern in favor of DEFAULT_NAME. The render_ui button now stays unfilled in every state (showing the terminal background), signals hover by underlining the bold label, dims for 150 ms on click via CLICK_FLASH_DURATION_MS, and appends a trailing '↗' to mark external links. In freebuff-models.ts, KIMI_MODEL and MINIMAX_M3_MODEL were each flipped to multimodal: true, MINIMAX_M3_MODEL's tagline changed from 'Frontier' to 'Smartest & multimodal', and both model ids were added to FREEBUFF_MULTIMODAL_MODEL_IDS so uploaded images get forwarded as real multimodal content.",
